All,

CMF has the attached flyer on their website. This 2=94 valve takes a full t=
urn to operate as oppose to the typical =BC turn ball valve.

Full turn closure is accomplished with a gear mechanism.  In our current pr=
oduct line gear operation is available in the larger sizes.

The supposed benefit is a =93softer=94 closure reducing the potential or ma=
gnitude of surges.

Shortly we will have gear operated PE ball valves available in 2=94 and 3=
=94 that will be a true water valve.

The CMF valve is a gas valve as evidenced by the use of Acetal and Nitrile.=
  We will identify where it is coming from in time.

Report any market contacts on this product.  If you get to look at one note=
 all marking details especially country of origin and report them.

J

